config.judge_prompt:
Search query: {query}
Product: {title}

Ignore whether this is the exact item someone would buy - judge only whether this product is a plausible TYPE of thing for what someone typing this search is looking for. Answer "no" if it's a different product category (e.g. an accessory when the query names the main product, or an unrelated product type), even if it shares a brand name or keyword with the query. Answer yes or no.
